Package: bhfvar
Title: Bayesian Hybrid Framework for Variance Decomposition in Complex Surveys
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", email = "jlee296@ua.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: Implements the Bayesian Hybrid Framework for variance decomposition
    in complex surveys with post-hoc domains. The package provides tools for
    separating substantive geographic variation from design artifacts and sampling
    noise, using Bayesian Pseudo-Likelihood estimation with multilevel models.
    Key features include dual estimand framework (Policy vs Descriptive estimands),
    de-attenuation for finite-sample variance inflation, and comprehensive
    diagnostic and visualization tools.
